+++ b/AGENTS.md
@@ -40,6 +40,13 @@ Cards automatically "postpone" (move to "not now") after inactivity:
 - Prevents endless todo lists from accumulating
 - Configurable via Account/Board settings
 
+### Stalled Cards
+
+Cards that flare up and then go cold are flagged as stalled:
+- A card "bursts" when three or more comments from at least two people land on it within a third of the board's auto-close period, or when someone is assigned to it or reopens it
+- The burst is remembered in `cards.burst_at`, and any activity on the card resets it
+- Two weeks of quiet after a burst marks the card as stalled: `Card.stalled` backs the `indexed_by=stalled` cards index
+
 ### UUID Primary Keys
 
 All tables use UUIDs (UUIDv7 format, base36-encoded as 25-char strings):
